ts, and optional navigation arrows.",keywords:["carousel","banner","slideshow","paging"]},{id:"COLOR_PICKER",title:"Color Picker",category:"Components",subCategory:"PICKERS",tags:["ui"],badge:"Swatches & Hex",description:"Interactive color swatch grid with active checkmark indicator, live preview, and validated custom #RRGGBB hex input.",keywords:["color","picker","hex","swatch"]},{id:"CONTEXT_MENU",title:"Context Menu",category:"Components",subCategory:"UI_PRIMITIVES",tags:["ui"],badge:"Popover & Actions",description:"Anchored popover context menu supporting tap or long-press triggers, icons, dividers, disabled items, and destructive actions.",keywords:["menu","context","popover","popup","action sheet"]},{id:"IMAGE_VIEWER",title:"Image Viewer",category:"Components",subCategory:"ENTERPRISE_LAYOUTS",tags:["ui"],badge:"Blur, Zoom & Swipe",description:"Full-screen image viewer over a blurred backdrop with zoom in/out controls, swipe navigation, counter, and captions.",keywords:["image","photo","viewer","zoom","gallery"]},{id:"ACTION_CARD",title:"ActionCard (Promo / In-App Offer)",category:"Components",subCategory:"ENTERPRISE_LAYOUTS",tags:["ui"],badge:"Offer Card",description:"Interactive promotional card featuring icons, title, description, and status tags.",keywords:["action card","promo","offer","card","banner","ui"]},{id:"SELECT_CHIP_GROUP",title:"SelectChipGroup (Category & Filter Pills)",category:"Components",subCategory:"PICKERS",tags:["ui"],badge:"Select Chips",description:"Supports single-choice pill filters and multi-select category tags with counter badges.",keywords:["select chip","chip","chips","pill","filter","category","ui"]},{id:"NUMBER_STEPPER",title:"NumberStepper (Tenure & Increment Control)",category:"Components",subCategory:"PICKERS",tags:["ui"],badge:"Stepper",description:"Precise numeric adjustment control with boundary limits, step size, and unit labels.",keywords:["stepper","number","tenure","increment","counter","ui"]},{id:"BOTTOM_SHEET_SELECT